        "PMC8282813::chunk::001::introduction::a325666ec3",
        "PMC10213035::chunk::001::introduction::73adf78dd5"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Conventional superalloy or ferritic-alloy approaches are limited by inadequate high-temperature capability and weight.",
